      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Thank you for participating in our youth baseball, softball and tee ball leagues!</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">This year we had over 600 athletes participating in our leagues around Columbus!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We want to hear about your experience with our program and the interactions with our community centers. We would also love to hear directly from your child about their experience. If you have more than one child, the survey can be used more than once.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/wellness/athletics/baseball/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">We look forward to seeing you on the field in the fall</a>.</p>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 22px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 18px;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc9yKHUDSkE5JWCMhd0w5uze6Z5_shLMgkzX0h-yowBfjL28w/viewform?usp=sf_link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Parents, Guardians and Caregivers Survey</a></h2>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 22px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 18px;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeraJ2lh6hVpNk5rrtRnxaIyPkpT3bIQ-Qm3q0bcsIiImVgtw/viewform?usp=sf_link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Participant Survey</a></h2>
